WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:11.496
A color mismatch between your own hair and the hairpiece can undermine the polished look of wedding-parent hair.

2
00:00:11.832 --> 00:00:18.048
That's because a mismatch makes the hairpiece obvious and looks unnatural.

3
00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:28.488
To prevent this, your current hair color — natural brown, light brown, black,

4
00:00:28.824 --> 00:00:35.808
wine, and so on — is carefully checked in a one-on-one consultation, and a matching hairpiece is prepared in advance.

5
00:00:36.144 --> 00:00:44.544
Even if your color is ambiguous or unusual, the artist can mix shades or find a workaround,

6
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:52.032
so it's essential to show your hair to the artist beforehand to avoid any surprises on the day.
